      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(1A) Leave and other conditions of service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(1A) Notwithstanding the Resource Assessment Commission Act 1989,\nduring the term of office of the Honourable Donald Gerard Stewart\nas Chairperson of the Resource Assessment Commission, the\nconditions of service (including entitlement to leave) applicable to\nhim shall be, with appropriate changes, the same as those\napplicable to a Judge of the Supreme Court of the Australian\nCapital Territory.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00791\n\n\n\nSection 7\n\nNational Crime Authority (Status and Rights of Former Chairman) Act 1984"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-1a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
