    {
      "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(3) Leave and other conditions of service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984#sec-7-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(3) During any period of long leave that is taken by the Honourable\nDonald Gerard Stewart in accordance with his entitlement under\nsubsection (2) in respect of a period of service referred to in that\nsubsection, he shall be paid remuneration at the rate at which\nremuneration is payable during that period to a Judge of the\nSupreme Court of New South Wales in respect of the holding of an\noffice of Judge of that Court.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) During any period of long leave that is taken by the Honourable\nDonald Gerard Stewart in accordance with his entitlement under\nsubsection (2) in respect of a period of service referred to in that\nsubsection, he shall be paid remuneration at the rate at which\nremuneration is payable during that period to a Judge of the\nSupreme Court of New South Wales in respect of the holding of an\noffice of Judge of that Court.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e7705471abf76d391aa4eb10a6dd44582b6005bd1390c3ac422464f512c464a7",
      "skos:note": "Pay remuneration to Judge of Supreme Court during long leave."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984#sec-7-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(3) Leave and other conditions of service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "(3) During any period of long leave that is taken by the Honourable\nDonald Gerard Stewart in accordance with his entitlement under\nsubsection (2) in respect of a period of service referred to in that\nsubsection, he shall be paid remuneration at the rate at which\nremuneration is payable during that period to a Judge of the\nSupreme Court of New South Wales in respect of the holding of an\noffice of Judge of that Court."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-3-norm",
