    {
      "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(4) Leave and other conditions of service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984#sec-7-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the Honourable Donald Gerard Stewart becomes entitled to a\npayment under section 4 of the Judges (Long Leave Payments) Act\n1979 at a time when he holds a full-time office under the\nCommonwealth:\n\n(a) the making of the payment shall be deferred until he has\nceased to hold such an office;\n\n(b) his qualifying service for the purpose of calculating the\namount payable shall not include any period of service in\nrespect of which he took long leave after becoming entitled\nto the payment;\n\n(c) the amount payable shall be calculated as if the annual rate of\nsalary that was payable to him immediately before his\nretirement or death was the annual rate of salary that was\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00791\n\n\n\nSection 8",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the Honourable Donald Gerard Stewart becomes entitled to a\npayment under section 4 of the Judges (Long Leave Payments) Act\n1979 at a time when he holds a full-time office under the\nCommonwealth:\n\n(a) the making of the payment shall be deferred until he has\nceased to hold such an office;\n\n(b) his qualifying service for the purpose of calculating the\namount payable shall not include any period of service in\nrespect of which he took long leave after becoming entitled\nto the payment;\n\n(c) the amount payable shall be calculated as if the annual rate of\nsalary that was payable to him immediately before his\nretirement or death was the annual rate of salary that was\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00791\n\n\n\nSection 8",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-7-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
