      "skos:note": "Payment to Judge upon ceasing full-time office"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984#sec-4-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 National Crime Authority (Status and Rights of Former Chairman) Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "payable to a Judge of the Supreme Court of New South\nWales at the time when the Honourable Donald Gerard\nStewart ceased to hold a full-time office under the\nCommonwealth; and\n\n(d) if he ceased to hold a full-time office under the\nCommonwealth as mentioned in paragraph (a) by reason of\nhis death, subsections 5(2), (3) and (4) of the Judges (Long\nLeave Payments) Act 1979 apply in respect of him as if he\nhad been a Judge within the meaning of that Act at the time\nof his death."
    },
